---
description: Rules for platform renderers
globs: packages/form-renderer-web/**,packages/form-renderer-native/**
---
- Shared behavior (migrate, isVisible, RBAC) comes from `form-core`. Do not reimplement.
- Only the leaf component mapping + layout interpretation is platform-specific.
- Web: responsive via antd 24-col (xs/sm/md/lg). Native: single column; honor only
  `hideOnMobile` / `mobileOrder`.
- All changes must be additive — older schema versions must keep rendering.
- `react` / `antd` / `react-native` are peerDependencies, never dependencies.
